Z||000000||Zorba||11-30-2000||12:10 PM||||Has anyone experienced a "ENGINE LIGHT" on after installing a v8 and been able to get rid of it? What causes this? If you know, let us know!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/racer.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Phil||11-30-2000||01:18 PM||||You could always read the codes. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Archie||11-30-2000||01:42 PM||||You are using a carburated engine and since you no longer have the original Fuel Injection system hooked <BR>up the Check Engine light will be on.<P>I'd suggest you take the bulb out.<P>Archie<BR>||||reg||1
